# Core project rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` before changing code.
- Read relevant files in `docs/` before architectural changes.
- Keep Phase 1 scope narrow.
- Prefer boring, explicit code over abstractions.
- Do not introduce a dependency to solve a problem already handled by the current stack.
- Every feature must have an acceptance criterion.
- Run relevant tests and typecheck after changes.
